#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "412_Dealer"
msgid "It looks like you don't have enough chips to play blackjack, sir."
msgstr "Señor, veo que no tiene las suficientes fichas para jugar blackjack."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "424_Dealer"
msgid "If you'd like to purchase chips, you can do so at the front desk."
msgstr "Si desea comprar más fichas, puede hacerlo en la mesa del frente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "436_Dealer"
msgid "Welcome to the blackjack table. You can play one game for as little as 100 chips. Care to try your luck?"
msgstr "Bienvenido a la mesa de blackjack. Puede empezar a jugar a partir de las 100 fichas. ¿Prueba su suerte?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "460_Haruka"
msgid "Uncle Kaz, I bet you can get 1,000 points in high-stakes blackjack!"
msgstr "Tío Kaz, ¡apuesto a que puedes conseguir 1.000 puntos en blackjack de altas apuestas!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "472_Kiryu"
msgid "(1,000 points in high-stakes blackjack... Should I give it a try?)"
msgstr "(1.000 puntos en blackjack de altas apuestas... ¿Debería intentarlo?)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "484_Dealer"
msgid "All right, I'll play."
msgstr "Muy bien, jugaré."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "496_Dealer"
msgid "Very good, sir."
msgstr "Muy bien, señor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "508_Haruka"
msgid "Good luck, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "¡Buena suerte, Tío Kaz!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "532_Dealer"
msgid "Not right now."
msgstr "Ahora no."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "544_Dealer"
msgid "Very well. We hope you'll play with us next time."
msgstr "Muy bien. Esperamos que vuelvas a jugar con nosotros."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "556_Haruka"
msgid "Aww, c'mon, let's play some blackjack!"
msgstr "¡Ay, vamos, juguemos al blackjack!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "568_Haruka"
msgid "Uncle Kaz! Can you get 2,000 points in high-stakes blackjack? I really wanna see you try..."
msgstr "¡Tío Kaz! ¿Puedes conseguir 2000 puntos en blackjack de altas apuestas? Tengo muchas ganas de verte intentarlo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "580_Kiryu"
msgid "(2,000 points in high-stakes blackjack... Should I give it a try?)"
msgstr "(2.000 puntos en blackjack de altas apuestas... ¿Debería intentarlo?)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "592_Dealer"
msgid "All right, I'll play."
msgstr "Muy bien, jugaré."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "604_Dealer"
msgid "Very good, sir."
msgstr "Muy bien, señor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "616_Haruka"
msgid "Good luck, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "¡Buena suerte, Tío Kaz!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "640_Dealer"
msgid "Not right now."
msgstr "Ahora no."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "652_Dealer"
msgid "Very well. We hope you'll play with us next time."
msgstr "Muy bien. Esperamos que vuelvas a jugar con nosotros."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "664_Haruka"
msgid "Awww, we're not going to play blackjack!?"
msgstr "¿¡Ay, no vamos a jugar al blackjack!?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "688_Dealer"
msgid "Welcome to the blackjack table. You can play one game for as little as 100 chips. Care to try your luck?"
msgstr "Bienvenido a la mesa de blackjack. Puede empezar a jugar a partir de las 100 fichas. ¿Prueba su suerte?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "700_Dealer"
msgid "I've noticed that you play blackjack quite often. Would you be interested in playing the house, one-on-one?"
msgstr "He notado que juegas blackjack con frecuencia. ¿Te interesaría enfrentarte a la casa, uno contra uno?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "712_Dealer"
msgid "What would you like to do?"
msgstr "¿Qué te gustaría hacer?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "724_Dealer"
msgid "All right, then. First, I'll need your 1,000 chips."
msgstr "De acuerdo. Primero necesitaré tus 1,000 fichas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "748_Dealer"
msgid "Thank you. Now, then, let's begin."
msgstr "Gracias. Ahora, comencemos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "772_Dealer"
msgid "Very well. Let's continue with normal blackjack, then."
msgstr "Perfecto. Continuemos con el blackjack normal, entonces."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "796_Dealer"
msgid "Sure, I'm feeling lucky today."
msgstr "Claro, hoy me siento afortunado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "808_Dealer"
msgid "Very good, sir."
msgstr "Muy bien, señor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "844_Dealer"
msgid "Not right now."
msgstr "Ahora no."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "856_Dealer"
msgid "I see. We hope you'll play next time."
msgstr "Ya veo. Espero que juegue la próxima vez."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "868_Dealer"
msgid "You seem to be short on chips. Please come back soon."
msgstr "Parece que va corto de fichas. Por favor, vuelva pronto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "880_Player"
msgid "Tell me the rules."
msgstr "Explícame las reglas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "892_Dealer"
msgid "This is a game between you and the house. Whoever gets three wins first wins the game."
msgstr "Este es un juego entre tú y la casa. El primero que gane tres rondas, gana la partida."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "904_Dealer"
msgid "Before the game begins, I'll need 1,000 chips for you to join. The payout differs depending on which deck is used."
msgstr "Antes de comenzar, necesitaré que aportes 1,000 fichas para participar. El pago varía según el tipo de baraja que se use."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "916_Deck Type and Payout"
msgid "Standard Deck: 2,000 chips\\r\nWithout 2/3/4: 2,500 chips\\r\nWithout 7/8/9: 2,000 chips\\r\nWithout J/Q/K: 4,000 chips"
msgstr "Baraja estándar: 2,000 fichas\\r\nSin 2/3/4: 2,500 fichas\\r\nSin 7/8/9: 2,000 fichas\\r\nSin J/Q/K: 4,000 fichas"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "928_Dealer"
msgid "These are the payouts for winning against me one-on-one."
msgstr "Estos son los premios por ganarme en un duelo cara a cara."

